      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْنَسَةٌ</span></b>  [an inf. n. of which the verb is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْنَسَتْ</span>, as is shown by the mention of the part. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُفَرْنِسَةٌ</span>,] A woman's <i>good managing of the affairs
of her house,</i> or <i>tent:</i> (Lth, K, TA:) the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is
augmentative. (TA.)

